# Bot art and other runtime assets stay as normal Git blobs.
#
# Velmora-House-Points on Railway builds this repo with Railpack from the
# GitHub archive (build log: "unpacking archive"). That snapshot does not
# smudge Git LFS, and .dockerignore drops .git, so a build-step
# `git lfs pull` cannot recover the bytes. Tracking these paths with LFS
# would deploy pointer text in place of the images the bot sends.
#
# Do not add patterns here for png/jpg/webp/gif/ttf (or the art directories)
# unless the Railway service is changed to a delivery path that actually
# fetches LFS objects before the process starts.
